OL,3,ATrump says US position on Falklands
OL,4,A'one of many' under review
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has said the United
OL,7,FStates' position on the Falkland
OL,8,FIslands is "one of many" under review,
OL,9,Fas he pressed the UK to increase
OL,10,Fmilitary spending.
OL,12,FThe US president said the UK has "got
OL,13,Fsome problems, but they'll get solved"
OL,14,Fwhen asked about defence funding as a
OL,15,Ffollow-up question to his response on
OL,16,Fthe Falklands.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
