OL,3,ATrump says US position on Falklands
OL,4,A'one of many' under review
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after The Daily Telegraph
OL,7,Freported US defence officials were
OL,8,Fdrawing up proposals to incentivise
OL,9,FNato allies to meet their spending
OL,10,Fpledges, with a threat to oppose UK
OL,11,Fsovereignty over the Falklands among
OL,12,Fthe possible options.
OL,14,FThe UK government responded by saying
OL,15,FFalkland islanders "are British with a
OL,16,Fright to determine their own future".
